{"symbol":"SHRIDINE","yahoo":"SHRIDINE.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Shri Dinesh Mills Limited","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Textile Manufacturing","website":"https://www.dineshmills.com","about":"Shri Dinesh Mills Limited manufactures and sells textile products in India and internationally. The company offers worsted fabrics for menswear, paper maker felts, and industrial textiles. It also provides press felts under the DINFLO, DINVENT, and DINPLY names; dryer screens, such as hi contact mono screens, uni screens, and spiral dryer fabrics; fiber and asbestos felts, including pipe and sheet felt products under the DINASORB name; and filter fabrics. The company serves the paper, board, and newsprint industries. It exports its products. Shri Dinesh Mills Limited was incorporated in 1935 and is based in Vadodara, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T08:31:29+00:00","quote":{"price":371.6,"prevClose":362.5,"marketCap":208.13,"high52":403.7,"low52":206.35,"pe":18.51,"bookValue":357.62,"dividendRate":1.5,"roe":null,"shares":0.5601,"insiders":64.63,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-08-19","2024-08-20","2024-08-21","2024-08-22","2024-08-23","2024-08-26","2024-08-27","2024-08-28","2024-08-29","2024-08-30","2024-09-02","2024-09-03","2024-09-04","2024-09-05","2024-09-06","2024-09-09","2024-09-10","2024-09-11","2024-09-12","2024-09-13","2024-09-16","2024-09-17","2024-09-18","2024-09-19","2024-09-20","2024-09-23","2024-09-24","2024-09-25","2024-09-26","2024-09-27","2024-09-30","2024-10-01","2024-10-03","2024-10-04","2024-10-07","2024-10-08","2024-10-09","2024-10-10","2024-10-11","2024-10-14","2024-10-15","2024-10-16","2024-10-17","2024-10-18","2024-10-21","2024-10-22","2024-10-23","2024-10-24","2024-10-25","2024-10-28","2024-10-29","2024-10-30","2024-10-31","2024-11-01","2024-11-04","2024-11-05","2024-11-06","2024-11-07","2024-11-08","2024-11-11","2024-11-12","2024-11-13","2024-11-14","2024-11-18","2024-11-19","2024-11-21","2024-11-22","2024-11-25